    mission:"To mobilise public revenue for national development through fair, efficient, and transparent tax administration.",
    vision:"To be a world-class revenue authority that enables Rwanda's prosperity.",
    coreValues:["Integrity","Professionalism","Innovation","Teamwork","Service Excellence"],
    cultureDescription:`<p>RRA offers a structured public-sector environment with strong emphasis on integrity, professionalism, and public service. The agency employs over 1,000 staff across Rwanda, with a culture that values efficiency, accountability, and continuous improvement.</p><p>Employees benefit from the stability of public-sector employment while working in a modern, technology-driven organisation. RRA invests significantly in staff training, including international tax administration programmes and professional certifications.</p>`,
