    socialMedia:{ linkedin:"https://linkedin.com/company/rwanda-biomedical-centre", twitter:"https://twitter.com/RBCRwanda", facebook:"https://facebook.com/RBCRwanda" },
    mission:"To strengthen Rwanda's health systems through innovative biomedical research, quality laboratory services, and evidence-based public health programmes.",
    vision:"A Rwanda where every citizen has access to quality health services backed by world-class research and diagnostics.",
    coreValues:["Excellence","Innovation","Integrity","Collaboration","Impact"],
    cultureDescription:`<p>RBC offers a unique environment where public health policy meets biomedical science. Employees work on nationally significant health programmes that directly impact millions of Rwandans. The culture is research-oriented, data-driven, and deeply mission-focused.</p><p>The centre attracts health professionals, researchers, and programme managers passionate about public health. RBC maintains strong partnerships with international research institutions, providing staff with exposure to cutting-edge global health research.</p>`,
